Theory reference: DHP2025_STRUCTURAL_FORMULATION_LEARNING_PROTOCOL.md supplies method questions, not a Dior ingredient recipe or donor chassis. No DHP/Luxe-level, proven-equal-depth or donor-independence promotion is claimed. A formal donor-independence acceptance receipt has NOT been obtained. The protocol's source floor is why the challenger's four-row deletion remains an experimental sub-arm, not a silent replacement.

