A's eight experimental omissions each have their own unresolved function: Alpha Ionone/petal approach; Orris Liquid/root texture; Orivone/dry contour; Benzyl Salicylate/cosmetic interface; Kephalis/woody junction; Cashmeran/textile grain; Suederal/suede seam; Heliotropal/almond-powder junction. A compares the whole architecture only, not eight isolated causal effects.

After the first architecture comparison, test ONE junction at a time against V2 at fixed surrounding stock doses and final mass:
- Suederal: replace 20 mg neat supplied product with 20 mg explicitly recorded DEP vehicle in the 6 g design. This fixes all other doses, not total fragrant product.
- Orivone: replace 20 mg with 20 mg DEP; independently compare Orris Liquid omission (200 mg stock becomes 182 mg DEP retained carrier + 18 mg documented replacement vehicle). Do not bundle the two claims.
- Cashmeran: 30 mg product to 30 mg DEP; Kephalis: 100 mg product to 100 mg DEP in a separate arm.
- Heliotropal: 60 mg working stock becomes 54 mg retained DEP + 6 mg replacement DEP. This isolates it from the root/textile module.
- Original texture package, if still useful: Orivone 20 + Cashmeran 30 + Heliotropal stock 60 becomes 54 mg retained DEP + 56 mg replacement DEP. It tests the package, not individual causes.
- Challenged B14 package: omit Orivone 20 + Cashmeran 30 + Suederal 20 + Heliotropal stock 60; replace with 54 mg retained DEP + 76 mg explicitly recorded replacement DEP. This is a compressed experimental arm, not an approved source replacement.
- Tonka coupling: test product Tonkarome 180 mg + Coumarin 68 mg versus 200 + 48 mg at fixed 248 mg combined product. Stock carriers differ: the first uses 720 mg TEC/272 mg DEP, the second 800 mg TEC/192 mg DEP. Match both to 800 mg TEC and 272 mg DEP, then the same final mass. This tests body/definition allocation, not equal coumarin chemistry or equal odor strength.
- Single musk alternative: 600 mg Ambrettolide stock = 60 mg supplied musk + 540 mg DPG; compare 60 mg neat Habanolide + 540 mg DPG under independently verified stock authority. Do not add both to avoid choosing.

Prepare two genuinely independent coded sets only after execution/handling prerequisites are met. Balance order across sessions, use identical application mass and substrate, record free descriptions before ratings at 0/5/30/120/240 min, and include a documented authentic reference only if actually available. Assess identity first, then iris continuity, interior access, unwanted takeovers, coherence and liking separately. Keep a change only for a repeatable target-linked benefit without identity/coherence/liking loss. Discordant or indistinguishable results stay UNRESOLVED. Two personal sessions do not support invented statistical significance.

